<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Barrick Gold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Barrick Gold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers initiated coverage of Barrick Gold Corp with an outperform rating, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Lehman cut its rating on Pegasus Gold Inc to neutral from outperform, the source said.</p>
<p>-- Barrick was down 1/2 at 24-3/4 on the NYSE while Pegasus fell 1/8 to 10-1/4 on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
